    "thirdDie": "d8",
    "firstDieName": "Immunosecurity",
    "secondDieName": "Runaway Experiments",
    "thirdDieName": "Corrupted Computer Systems",
    "description": "<p><strong>Center for Advanced Genomic Research</strong></p><p>One of the most sophisticated genetics laboratories on the planet. Biomancer took it over to clone humans and “program” them. A unique Immunosecurity System adapts to intruders, growing more hostile until they leave.</p><p><strong>Levels / seeded threats:</strong></p><ul><li>Ground Level: 1 Antibody Bot</li><li>Basement 1 (Admin): H/2 Antibody Bots</li><li>Basement 2 (Agricultural): H/2 Defender Pods</li><li>Basement 3 (Cryogenics): H/2 Cryopedes</li><li>Basement 4 (Radiation): H/2 Giant Angry Shaggy Things</li><li>Basement 5 (Gene Splicing): H/2 Nanite Swarms — goal computer</li></ul><p>Security responses are physical or electronic depending on the triggering Overcome. Twists may also unleash runaway experiments.</p><p><em>Trait dice use printed labels (Immunosecurity / Runaway Experiments / Corrupted Computer Systems); die sizes curated.</em></p>"
  },
